$DATUM Xin, Ku; Huang, He; Jiang, Hualiang; Liu, Hong
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of Combinatorial Chemistry (2009), 11(3), 338-340

