$DATUM Synthetic procedure for compounds 43 (Scheme S4). Stage A. To the stirred
solution of 1-(2,3-Difluoro-phenyl)-ethanone (1.56g, 10 mmol) in DMF (10
ml) was added aqueous solution of NaSH (20%, 3.8g, 13.5 mmol) under ice
cooling and Ar atmosphere. Then mixture was stirred overnight, diluted
with water and was extracted with ethyl acetate (2*10 ml). The combined
organic phase is washed with brine, dried over Na2SO4, and concentrated
in vacuo. 1-(3-Fluoro-2-methylsulfanyl-phenyl)-ethanone. Yield: 1.71g
(93%).
